      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a quiet, high-end experience, you should create profiles based on behavior or group dynamics. Consider profiling \"Party/Social Gatherings,\" where larger groups might lead to noise issues, requiring discreet monitoring of gathering areas. Another profile is \"High-Anticipation/Troubled Guests,\" who might show signs of instability or dissatisfaction, warranting a watchful, proactive security presence. Finally, you might profile \"Unannounced Groups,\" as unexpected arrivals can quickly disrupt the hotel's cultivated atmosphere.",
